      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0",
      "artist": "Martin Stone from Reading, United Kingdom",
      "description": "Now which lever was I supposed to pull?\nThe museum also had and engine driving simulator. Not as complicated as this but non the less a realistic experience as the 'screen' windows showed you steaming along the track, you could feel the loco running on the tracks and you could operate the regulator, brake and reversing leaver to control the loco. Boys never grow up :-)\n\nThe STEAM Museum website",
